{{Quote|You're with me. The rest of you, get on that skiff. Do your best to act Imperial.|[[Athex]]|<ref name="Star Wars: Secrets of the Empire">''[[Star Wars: Secrets of the Empire]]''</ref>}}
'''Skiff''' was a term which could be used to describe a number of different types of vehicle, including both [[starship]]s and atmospheric vehicles. The [[Hutt]] [[crime lord]] [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure|Jabba]] owned several [[Bantha-II cargo skiff]]s, which he used to transport prisoners to the [[Great Pit of Carkoon]].<ref name="Episode VI" /> [[Jedi]] [[Padawan]] [[Kevmo Zink]] found that skiffs were excellent craft for carrying out [[split roll]]s.<ref name="Path of Deceit">''[[The High Republic: Path of Deceit]]''</ref>

Some skiffs were made out of parts from the [[Galactic Empire]], one have a [[laser cannon]] turret,<ref name="The Doza Dilemma" /> the spotlight, the ladder, and the rope,<ref name="The First Order Occupation">{{Resistance|The First Order Occupation}}</ref> and other four did not have a weapon, instead having three spotlights.<ref name="Hunt on Celsor 3">{{Resistance|Hunt on Celsor 3}}</ref>

